Kompas studio photo v1. Editorial visual review approved.
Original SHA-256: f2353190bcb288a1a47de39a8c89dbbeacf68042fdec1fcdb99544204140b057
On a workshop table, three related visual stages: raw wood, small measured practice piece, and one finished joint. Grounded illustration of knowledge turning to practical ability. Make one original ultra-realistic live editorial studio photograph for the independent magazine Kompas. Wide landscape about 1.9:1, central subject inside the middle 75% for a consistent crop; clear plausible optics and readable shadow detail. Real controlled directional daylight, neutral-warm color, tactile ordinary materials, one purposeful subject and an interesting but restrained sense of depth. Photographic, no layout or decorative graphics. No people, faces, hands, silhouettes, visible lettering, numbers, logos, neon, fake interface or watermarks.
